The patient is also being followed for diabetes. He has been watching his sweets, but his hemoglobin A1c was 60. He is concerned about the medications he is on.

The patient is a San Francisco 49er fan and is excited about the Super Bowl. He is not sure if he will be able to beat the Los Angeles Rams.

